31,1,1,talk,Servas,,I hope everyone slept well. Let us begin our deliberation.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I noticed Sakura was very eager to accuse others yesterday.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,May,,"Now that you mention it, she was practically pointing fingers at Jonathan immediately.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I found it curious as well.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,What?! I was just being playful! You guys are ganging up on me!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
